<report>
<title>Abridged life table</title>
<table>
<tr><th>Interval</th><th>Population</th><th>Deaths</th><th>Death rate</th></tr>
<block name="inputs"><tr><td>@int</td><td>@{pop:roundu}</td><td>@{dead:roundu}</td><td>@{rate:roundu}</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Interval</th><th>Probability of dying [q<sub>x</sub>]</th><th>SE of q<sub>x</sub></th><th><ci>@{pc:round2}% CI for q<sub>x</sub></ci></th></tr>
<block name="pdying"><tr><td>@int</td><td>@{q:roundu}</td><td>@{se:roundu}</td><td><ci>@{lci:roundu}  to  @{uci:roundu}</ci></td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Interval</th><th>Living at start [l<sub>x</sub>]</th><th>Dying [d<sub>x</sub>]</th><th>Fraction of last interval of life [a<sub>x</sub>]</th></tr>
<block name="living"><tr><td>@int</td><td>@l</td><td>@d</td><td>@{a:roundu}</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Interval</th><th>Years in interval [L<sub>x</sub>]</th><th>Years beyond start of interval [T<sub>x</sub>]</th></tr>
<block name="years"><tr><td>@int</td><td>@L</td><td>@T</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Interval</th><th>Expectation of life [e<sub>x</sub>]</th><th>SE of e<sub>x</sub></th><th><ci>
  @{pc:round2}% CI for e<sub>x</sub></ci></th></tr>
<block name="expectation"><tr><td>@int</td><td>@{e:roundu}</td><td>@{se:roundu}</td><td><ci>@{lci:roundu}  to  @{uci:roundu}</ci></td></tr></block>
</table>
<block name="util">

<table>
<tr><th>Interval</th><th>Adjusted (@uti) expectation of life [e<sub>x</sub>]</th></tr>
<block name="adjusted"><tr><td>@int</td><td>@{eh:roundu}</td></tr></block>
</table>
</block>

<p>Median expectation of life (age at which half of original cohort survives) = @{med:roundu}<br />
<ci>@{pc:round2}% CI by Monte Carlo (@its) simulation = @{med_lci:roundu}  to  @{med_uci:roundu}</ci></p>

<p>Expectation of life at birth = @{elb:roundu}<br />
<ci>@{pc:round2}% CI by Chiang variance estimate = @{elb_lci:roundu}  to  @{elb_uci:roundu}</ci><br />
<ci>@{pc:round2}% CI by Monte Carlo (@its) simulation = @{elb_mc_lci:roundu}  to  @{elb_mc_uci:roundu}</ci></p>
</report>
